<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TI" style="id">- Melo New Testament Latin</book>
  <para style="h">1Ximot oosa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Phawuloosa Ximaatoosas Xaafintteez Tiina Kiitaa</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Ximot oosa</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Xim.</para>
  <para style="mt1">Phawuloosa Ximaatoosas Xaafeez Tiina Kiita</para>
  <para style="imt">Gelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Ximaatoosa ginttinttiz, ammaniza panithay, Xiqqa Iisiya yelintteezaya (Haw. O. 16:1-3). Ee indii baggar Ayihude; e fa aday baggar ma Girike asii. E Phawuloosara pettipp oothizannee Wonggile oosor e Phawuloosas ukke maadee. Phawuloosa Ximaatoosas xaafeez tiina kiitay hayidzii aafe qofita odiza.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ubbapp tiinatii kiitay, woosa keetha denddeez worddo timirtte bagga miinthii odiza. Yeykka imath timirttay Ayihude timirttaypp bagga, ma Ayihude maaqqekka asay timirttaypp bagga aykkeeza. Yeykka, «Yha benttiz alamay nagarara iiteez gishos as atotith denggodayis duma maaqqeez xuura erodayis, pettii pettii kathita meekka ashshodayisinnee machcho ekkeka woy azin gelekka ashshodayis koshshiza» yeegiza qofa baaso udii dendeeza.</para>
  <para style="ip">Nam7inth qofay, woosa keetha aqiso baggannee goynno woga bagga taamarssiza timirtta, yhay garkk woosa keetha kaalithizaynnee unttan maaddizitay ab garkk maara yess yezodayis beezizako odiza.</para>
  <para style="ip">Wurssithal, Ximaatoosa Yesuus Kiristtoosas oothiza lo77o as wayizii maaqqodayis beezizako, ma duma duma ammaniza asay kantta ees yez adetithay abizako, Phawuloosa eza zoreez zora beeziza.</para>
  <para style="iot">1 Ximaatoosa kiitay aykkeez qofita</para>
  <para style="io1">Gelo <char style="ior"><ref loc="1TI 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Woosa keeth baggannee izo aqisiza asayis inggintteez aqiso woga <char style="ior"><ref loc="1TI 1:3-3:16">1:3—3:16</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ximaatoosas inggintteez timirtta <char style="ior"><ref loc="1TI 4:1-6:21">4:1—6:21</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="ie"/>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TI 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 1:1"/>Nuna ashshiza Xoossaynnee nu ufayisa maaqqeez Yesuus Kiristtoosa azazor, Yesuus Kiristtoosa hawaare maaqqeez, Phawuloosapp, <verse eid="1TI 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 1:2"/>ammanor taas tuma na7a maaqqeez Ximaatoosas.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 1:2">
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 16:1">Haw. O. 16:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Xooss nu Adaypp, nu Goda Yesuus Kiristtoosa aadho keehatithay, maarotithayinnee sarotithay nees maaqqo.<verse eid="1TI 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Worddo timirttepp naagintto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 1:3"/>Taanii Maqadoona yhanigttar nena hadareezay garkk, pettii pettii asitay worddo timirtte taamarssizana kayodayis ne Efesoone gam7oday garkk ta koyiza. <verse eid="1TI 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 1:4"/>Unttii maaddoowa tosse odonnee wursithii baa fa kochchii payido ashshoday garkk odoba. Yey garkkez baz palama kaalithinepp attin ammanor oosinttiza Xooss oosayis maaddooya. <verse eid="1TI 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 1:5"/>Yha azazay aafe qofay geesh wozinapp, lo77o kahappennee tuma ammanopp benttiz siiqo. <verse eid="1TI 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 1:6"/>Pettii pettii asitay yhaya ashshii, pathoowa cere palamako maaqqeeza. <verse eid="1TI 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 1:7"/>Unttii Xooss higga asitamaare maaqqodayis koyiza. Zini unttii ab odizako woy nuusay tuma gi odizanakka erooya.<verse eid="1TI 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 1:8"/>Asii beezizay garkk higger maadinttiko higge lo77o maaqqeezana nu eriza. <verse eid="1TI 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 1:9"/>Akaakodayis beezizay higge haayo asayis medhinttekkaza nu eriza, Zini higge, higge mentheezita, daafa oothizita, Xoosse yashittoozita, shemppo wodhizita, nagaranchchita, geeshshetithii baazita, tunita, hara attozin fa indo woy ade wodhizita, <verse eid="1TI 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 1:10"/>laammizita, dhiirathii dhhiirathar laammizita, as bayizizita, worddanchchita, worddor caaqqizita, woy tuma timirttera woli hellowa aba ooso ubba oothizitayisii. <verse eid="1TI 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 1:11"/>Yha tuma timirttay bonchchonnee anjjintteez Xoossay ta awaajjoday garkk taas hadara inggeez Wonggile gancce yeza.<verse eid="1TI 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Xooss maarotethay baggar Phawuloosa galateez galata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 1:12"/>Tana fa oosos shuumii ye oosayis beeziza gi payidii ta oothiza oosayis taas wolqqa inggeez nu Goda Kiristtoosa Yesuusana ta galatiza. <verse eid="1TI 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 1:13"/>Taanii yhaypp tiina cazhizaya, bayi7izannee kawushiseeza maaqqikokka taanii yeya erekkannee ammanekka ootheez gishos Xoossii tana maareeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:3">Haw. O. 8:3</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 9:4-5">9:4-5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1TI 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 1:14"/>Nu Goday fa aadho keehatithaypp taal afa gogisi, ye aadho keehetithar ammanonnee siiqo Kiristtoosa Yesuusa baggar taas inggeeza.<verse eid="1TI 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 1:15"/>«Kiristtoosa Yesuusa nagaranchchita ashshodayis yha alame ye7eeza» giz qaalay ammanthizannee as ubbay ekkodayis beezizaya. Ubbapp aadheez nagaranchchay tana. <verse eid="1TI 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 1:16"/>Zini medhina de7o ekkodayis eza ammaniza asayis taanii aaziso maaqqoday garkk Yesuus Kiristtoosa tana gaame danda7eeza. Taas ubbaypp aadhiz nagaranchchayis Xoossii fa maarotithi gaanttheeza. <verse eid="1TI 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 1:17"/>Aafer benttowazitayis, pettii Xoossayis, yhayqqowazayis, medhina Kaatayis, medhinapp medhina hellodayis galatannee bonchcho maaqqo. Amin7e.<verse eid="1TI 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 1:18"/>Ta na7a Ximaatoosa, kasse nebagga nabitay odeez qaalayil afa eqqii yha kiita hadara nees inggiza. Ne ye qaala kaallii lo77o ola olinttoba. <verse eid="1TI 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 1:19"/>Ammanonnee lo77o kaha nees yezo. Pettay pettay kahay gizaya ixxii mare baa markkabe dhabizay garkk fa ammana dhabiseeza. <verse eid="1TI 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 1:20"/>Ya asitay gancce Hemeneesannee Iskkinddire yeza. Unttii taamarii Xoossa cashe ashshoday garkk taanii Xalahes unttan aathii inggeeza.<verse eid="1TI 1:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TI 2"/>
  <para style="s1">Woosa baggannee goynnobagga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 2:1"/>Xooss goynnonnee bonchcho kumeez de7or asayis, woossodayis, guurodayisnnee galatodayis beezizana taanii nena zoriza. <verse eid="1TI 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 2:2"/>Nuunii lo77o ayyana yessarannee geeshshetithar Xooss goynnittar sarotithirannee dacc geez yess yezoday garkk kaatitayisinnee shuumitay ubbayis woossoytta. <verse eid="1TI 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 2:3"/>Yey garkk woosay nuna ashshiza Xoossay tiina lo77onnee ufayssizabazii. <verse eid="1TI 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 2:4"/>Xoossii as ubbay attoday garkkennee tuma eroday garkk koyiza. <verse eid="1TI 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 2:5"/>Pettii Xooss yeza. Xoossisinnee asis gancce maaqqii dabothiza pettay yeza; eekka as maaqqeez Kiristtoosa Yesuusa. <verse eid="1TI 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 2:6"/>E as ubba wozodayis fana aathii inggeeza. Xoossii fa woder as ubba wozodayis koyizana beeziza markkay yhaya. <verse eid="1TI 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 2:7"/>Xoossii tana Wonggiles asitamaarennee hawaare udii dooreezay yeyisii. Taanii tuma odiza; worddotooya; ammanonnee tuma qaala Ayihude maaqqekka asayis taamarisodayigarkk Xoossii tana shuumeeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 1:11">2 Xim. 1:11</ref></char></note><verse eid="1TI 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 2:8"/>Yeyi gishos, ubba aqo yez dhiirathitay, fana Xoossayis dummasii, wachchinnee kachch ashii, fa geezheez kucita afa denthii Xooss woossoday garkk koyiza.<verse eid="1TI 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 2:9"/>Yey garkkekka maachchitay fa omma dathara woy worqqara woy inqqo worqqara woy al7o aflar fana buqquror baazin, yashatitharannee haayottithar beeziza womaanotith afila ma77o.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 3:3">1 Phix. 3:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1TI 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 2:10"/>Zini Xoossayis ta goynniza giz maachchitay paas beezizay garkk lo77o baz ootho.<verse eid="1TI 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 2:11"/>Maachchii ubba bazar kiitinttithar si77i gi tamaaro. <verse eid="1TI 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 2:12"/>Taanii maachchitay tamaarssoday garkk woy dhiirathal afa mawute ekkoday garkk baazin si77i gi yezoday garkk koyiza. <verse eid="1TI 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 2:13"/>Addaama tiina medhintteeza; guyeppe Hiwaanna medhintteeza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:7">Medhe. 2:7</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 2:21-22">21-22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1TI 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 2:14"/>Dooshintteezanannee Xooss higga mentheezan maachchatipp attin Addaama baaya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:1-6">Medhe. 3:1-6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1TI 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 2:15"/>Zini maachchii ammanor, siiqorannee geeshshatithar fana haarii yeziko na7ita yelor attoda.<verse eid="1TI 2:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TI 3"/>
  <para style="s1">Woosa keeth cimita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 3:1"/>Oonkka, «Woosa keeth kaalithiza as maaqqodayis koyko lo77o baz amottiza» giz oday tuma. <verse eid="1TI 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 3:2"/>Woosa keeth kaalithiza as borinttowaza, pettii machcho aadda ekkeezaya, maarar yezaya, fana haarizaya, beezizay garkk oothizaya, imathe mokkizaya, taamarsso danda7izaya,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2-7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="TIT 1:6-9">Tito 1:6-9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1TI 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 3:3"/>mathoowaza, walasoowaza, palamowaza, haayo, miishe siiqoowaza, <verse eid="1TI 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 3:4"/>e na7itay ees kiitinttizannee bonchchizitaya, fa kara asa aqiso danda7izaya maaqqodayis beeziza. <verse eid="1TI 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 3:5"/>Pettii as fa kara aqisodayis danda7aam ixxiko, Xooss woosa keeth wayizii aqisodayis danda7ee?<verse eid="1TI 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 3:6"/>Utirar kumii, daabuloosa pirddintteezayn garkk pirddinttaamay garkk, haga ammaneez as maaqqodayis beezoowa. <verse eid="1TI 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 3:7"/>Borinttaamay garkkennee Xalahe xike gancce gelaamay garkk ye athay ammanoowa as kale lo77o markkatithii yeza as maaqqodayis beeziza.<verse eid="1TI 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Woosa keeth daaqonita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 3:8"/>Yey garkkekka ma woosa keeth daaqonitay bonchchintteezita, nam77ii inxaris odinttowazita, mathisiz ushsh uzhoozita, miishe dosoozita, <verse eid="1TI 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 3:9"/>ammano xuura geeshsha kahar naagizita maaqqodayis beeziza. <verse eid="1TI 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 3:10"/>Unttii tiinatii paacinttodayis koshshiza; unttal afa bore baazita maaqqiko, woosa keeth daaqone maaqqii ootho.<verse eid="1TI 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 3:11"/>Yey garkkekka, maachchitay bonchchintteezita, zigirozita, maarar yezita, ubba bazar ammaninttizita maaqqodayis beeziza.<verse eid="1TI 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 3:12"/>Woosa keeth daaqonitay pettii machcha aadda yeza maaqqo. Fa na7itannee fa kara loythii aqisizitaya maaqqodayis beeziza. <verse eid="1TI 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 3:13"/>Woosa keeth daaqone maaqqii, lo77o ooso oothizitayis, unttis gita bonchcho beeziza ma Kiristtoosa Yesuusal paas yez ammano bagga ododayis minotith denggoda.<verse eid="1TI 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Damma xuura</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 3:14"/>Taanii yha kiita nees xaafittar, ellisii neeko ye7oda gi ufayss gaddiza. <verse eid="1TI 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 3:15"/>Zini taanii ye7ekka gam7iko, Xooss kara asay wayizii yezodayis beezizako erod garkk yhaya nees xaafiza. De7o Xooss karay tumatithis tuussinnee baaso. <verse eid="1TI 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 3:16"/>Nu ammano xuuray sidhe bayth gita.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">Kiristtoosa as maaqqii bentteeza;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">E tumatitha Geeshsha Ayyanay markkatteeza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">Kiitanchchos bentteeza;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">E kaatetithay ubbayis sabbakintteeza.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">Alamel yez asayir ammanintteeza;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">bonchchor salo ekintteeza.<verse eid="1TI 3:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TI 4"/>
  <para style="s1">Worddo asitamaarita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 4:1"/>Wursith wode balithiza ayyaanatannee tuna ayyanitay timirtta kaallii, pettii pettii asay ammana kaddodana Geeshsha Ayyanay qonccisii odeeza. <verse eid="1TI 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 4:2"/>Yey garkk timirtte u kahay doccin, asa balithiza worddo asitamaaritaypp yi7iza.<verse eid="1TI 4:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 4:3"/>Yey garkk asitay ekonnee gelo kayiza, ammanizitayinnee tuma eriza asitay eza galatitar maaday garkk Xoossii medhdheez katha «Miipate» gi kayiza. <verse eid="1TI 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 4:4"/>Xoossii medhdheez baz ubbay lo77o. Xooss galatii ekkiko alla wodhdhizabaz abikka baaya. <verse eid="1TI 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 4:5"/>Ubba baz Xoossa qaalarannee woosar geeshshi maaqqiza.<verse eid="1TI 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiristtoosas ammanintteez aylle maaqqith</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 4:6"/>Yha timirtta ammaniza asa tamarisko yesuus kiristtoosas lo77o ayille ne maaqqada. Ammano qaalannee ne kaaliza lo77o timirtta taamariko ne dicay erinttoda <verse eid="1TI 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 4:7"/>Zini maadee baa tuma maaqqekka odappennee cima maachchitay kaa7iza toseepp haakkoba. Xooss aazor nena loohisoba. <verse eid="1TI 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 4:8"/>Asii fa asetitha asho oosos loohiso xiqqa wodes maaddiza. Zini Xooss aazo loohisay yhattekka ye7od de7os ufayss yez gishos ubbabazis maaddiza. <verse eid="1TI 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 4:9"/>Yha qaalay as ubbay ekkodayis beeziz turo oda. <verse eid="1TI 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 4:10"/>Nuunii as ubba, ubbapp aathii ammanizita ashshiza de7o Xoossaypp ekkod gi ufayisar naagiza gishos, nuunii oosor daaburizannee butitiza.<verse eid="1TI 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 4:11"/>Yhaya kiittobannee tamaarssoba. <verse eid="1TI 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 4:12"/>Neenii na7a maaqqeez gishos nena oonkka leqqippe. Zini ammanizitayis neenii odar, oosor, siiqor, ammanorannee geeshshetithar aaziso maaqqoba. <verse eid="1TI 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 4:13"/>Taanii ye7od hellodayis asayis geeshsha maxaafa nabbabor, sabbakorannee tamaarssor minggoba. <verse eid="1TI 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 4:14"/>Tinbbite odorannee, cimitay fa kushe neel afa gaddeez wode neenii ekkeez, neell yez Geeshsha Ayyana imotita leqqippe.<verse eid="1TI 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 4:15"/>Ne dicay as ubbayis qonccoday garkk yeya miinthii qoppoba, yhaya ubba wode oothoba. <verse eid="1TI 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 4:16"/>Ne ommasinnee ne timirttayis naaginttoba. Neenii yeya ubba wode oothiko nenannee nena si7izita ashshoda.<verse eid="1TI 4:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TI 5"/>
  <para style="s1">Ammanizitayis beeziza zore</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 5:1"/>Dhiirath cimita ne ade garkk bonchchor zorobapp attin kaccippe. Yelaga dhiirathita ne ishe udii bo7oba. <verse eid="1TI 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 5:2"/>Cima maachchita ne indii garkk, yelaga maachchita ne mishii garkk, folo geeshshetithar bo7oba.<verse eid="1TI 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 5:3"/>Azinii yhayqqeezita tuma maadee koshshiza ami7ita bonchchoba. <verse eid="1TI 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 5:4"/>Zini am7atay na7itay woy na7a na7itay yeziko, ye na7itay Xooss aazo beezodayis fana yeleezityisinnee, fa wogga aayisinnee wogga ade maaddii kushe mahith tamaaro. Yeyi Xooss ufayssiza bazii.<verse eid="1TI 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 5:5"/>Fa ubbas yez tuma am7at Xoossapp maadee denggodayis ufayisar naagiza. Gallasannee qamma Xoossii fana maaddoday garkk woossizannee oyciza. <verse eid="1TI 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 5:6"/>Zini yha alamel lo77o yess aadda koyiz am7at path yezar yhayqqeezano. <verse eid="1TI 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 5:7"/>Oonkka unttan boraamay garkk yha kiita asita taamarssoytta. <verse eid="1TI 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 5:8"/>Zini fa dabbos, ubbaypp aathii fa kara asayis qoppoowa oonkka fa ammana kaddeeza; ammanoowa asappeka aadheez iita.<verse eid="1TI 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 5:9"/>Laythii usuppun tamm kumekka azinii yhiyqqeez maachchita am7e sunth mazggabal xaafippe. Ma yeyil afa pettii azina yezanno maaqqodayis koshshiza. <verse eid="1TI 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 5:10"/>Na7ita dishor, imathe mokor, geeshshitay toke meechchar, metinttiza asa maader, lo77o ooso ubbayis fana aathii inggeezano lo77o oosor erintteezanno maaqqodayis beeziza.<verse eid="1TI 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 5:11"/>Zini azinttay yhayqqeez na7atith maachitay suntha mazggaba xaapippe. Unttan azine gelo gelo giz asho amay aykkiz wode Kiristtoosa kaddoda. <verse eid="1TI 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 5:12"/>Unttii tiina geleez qaala mentheez gishos pirddinttoda. <verse eid="1TI 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 5:13"/>Yeyil afa unttii ooso dhabin keethapp keeth yuuyoda. Yuushsha aadda baazin hawozarannee fana gelisowa aqo gelii beezowabazii odinttinttiza. <verse eid="1TI 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 5:14"/>Yeyi gishos, nu morkkitay nuul afa odinttiza iita baz denggaam garkk na7atith maachchitay azin gelii, na7a yelii, fa keeth aqisoday garkk ta zoriza. <verse eid="1TI 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 5:15"/>Yhaypp tiina pettii pettii azinii yhayqqeez maachchitay Xalahe kaallii ammano ogepp bale kezeeza.<verse eid="1TI 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 5:16"/>Pettii ammaniza maachch asita fa kara maachchitay yeziko iza unttan maaddodayis beeziza. Yey garkk oothiko, woosa keethis toopay shawukiza. Ye wode woosa keethay maadee beeziza tuma maachchita maaddodayis danda7iza.<verse eid="1TI 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 5:17"/>Woosa keeth loythii heenggiz cimitay, ubbaypp aathii, qaala sabbakorannee tamaarssor daaburizitay dako bonchcho ekkodayis beeziza. <verse eid="1TI 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 5:18"/>Geeshsha Maxaafay, «Wudumma katha yedhdhiz gematay doona accippe» yhay garkk, «Oosanchchay fa damooza ekkodayis beeziza»<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:4">Nam7i. 25:4</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:10">Mat. 10:10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:7">Luq. 10:7</ref></char></note> yeegiza.<verse eid="1TI 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 5:19"/>Nam77ii woy hayidzii markka markkattekazin, woosa keeth cimal afa shiiqeez mooto si7ippe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 17:6">Nam7i. 17:6</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 19:15">19:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1TI 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 5:20"/>Yankkitay yashitoday garkk nagara oothiza oonakka as ubbay tiina gayiloytta.<verse eid="1TI 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 5:21"/>Neenii as sino be7ekka, petta pettaypp shaakkekka yha kiita naagod garkk Xoossa, Goda Yesuus Kiristtoosannee maraxintteez kiitanchchitay tiina ta nena zoriza. <verse eid="1TI 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TI 5:22"/>Ool afakka ne kushe gaddii shuumodayis ellesippe. Haritay nagarayid gelippe; nena geeshshetithar naagoba.<verse eid="1TI 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TI 5:23"/>Neenii ubba wode hargginttiza gishonnee ne ulo harggay gishos haath aadda uzhippe; xiqqa woyne uzhoba.<verse eid="1TI 5:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TI 5:24"/>Pettii pettii asitay nagaray qoncce; u nagaray unttan pirddodayis unttapp tiina aadhiza, zin yhankkitay nagaray guyeppe gam7ii qoncciza. <verse eid="1TI 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TI 5:25"/>Yey garkk, lo77o oosaykka qoncce; qonccer oothaam ixxikokka geemmodayis danda7ooya.<verse eid="1TI 5:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1TI 6"/>
  <para style="s1">Ayllitayis inggintteez zore</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 6:1"/>Xooss sunthaynnee nu timirttay cazhinttamay garkk aylletitha yezitay fana haariza godita bonchcho. <verse eid="1TI 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 6:2"/>Ammaniza godittay yez ayllitay, u goditay unttis ishe maaqqeez gishos unttan leqqippe. U oosayid maaddinttiza goditay, ammanintteezitannee dosintteezita maaqqeez gishos unttii kaseesaypp aathii oothodayis beeziza. Neenii yhaya tamaarssodayisnnee u udod garkk zorodayis beeziza.<verse eid="1TI 6:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Worddo timirttennee tuma duretith</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 6:3"/>Oonkka duma timirtte tamaarssiko, nu Goda Yesuus Kiristtoosa tuma qaalarayinnee nu ammano timirttayir woli helloayaa. <verse eid="1TI 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 6:4"/>Ye athay utirar dapinttinepp attin akkokka erooyaa. Unttis pettii qofal afa palamodayisnnee kaccodayis iita amo yeza. Yeyi qanaate, walasse, cashshe, iita sidhennee, <verse eid="1TI 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 6:5"/>giigoowa palama kaalithiza. Ma unttis zhuca wozina yeza; tumakka baleeza; unttii Xooss goynno duretith denggodayis oge gi qoppiza.<verse eid="1TI 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 6:6"/>Zini taas yezanna gidoda giz asis Xoossa goynno gita wodhe. <verse eid="1TI 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 6:7"/>Nuunii yha alama abikka ekii ye7ekkaya. Ma eepp akkokka ekkii yhanggaamii. <verse eid="1TI 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 6:8"/>Nuus kathannee ma7o yeziko yeyi gidoda. <verse eid="1TI 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 6:9"/>Zini duretithii koyizitay paacennee xihe gancce geliza. As boozithizannee qohiza iita amor pokkiza. <verse eid="1TI 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 6:10"/>Miishe siiqo iitatith ubbayis pultto. Pettay pettay miishe amottittar ammanopp balinttii gaame uni7annee azano gancce fana oleeza.<verse eid="1TI 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ximaatoosas inggintteez zorennee azazo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 6:11"/>Xoossa aso, neenii yeypp haakkoba. Xillotith, Xooss goynno, ammano, siiqo, danda7annee haayotithii kaalloba. <verse eid="1TI 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 6:12"/>Ammano bute loyth butitoba. Ne xeegintteez wode gaame asay tiina ne luule markkatteez medhina de7ana aykkoba. <verse eid="1TI 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 6:13"/>Ubbayis de7o inggiz Xooss tiinannee, Phenxe Philaaxoosa tiina lo77o markka markkatteez Kiristtoos Yesuusa tiina ta nena azaziza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 18:37">Wan. 18:37</ref></char></note> <verse eid="1TI 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 6:14"/>Nu Goda Yesuus Kiristtoosa qonccod hellodayis yha azaza buutannee boro bayth naagoba. <verse eid="1TI 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 6:15"/>Fa aadda ubba haariza bonchcho Xoossay, kaatitay kaatay, goditay Goday, fa qoppeez qamma Yesuus Kiristtoosana mahii kiittoda. <verse eid="1TI 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 6:16"/>Pettii e aadday yhayqqowaza. Oonkka shiiqodayis danda7oowa poo7o yeza. Oonkka eza be7ekkaya; ma be7adayiskka danda7ooya. Bonchchonnee medhina wolqqay ees maaqqo. Amin7e.<verse eid="1TI 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 6:17"/>Yha alame duritay cere dhabiz shalor ufayis gaddamay garkkennee ceeqqaamay garkk odoytta. Nuus beeziza baz pucisii inggiza nuna anjjiza, dure Xoossayil ammaninttoday garkk unttan azazoda. <verse eid="1TI 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 6:18"/>Unttii lo77o ooso oothoday garkk lo77o oosor duritoday garrkk, keehitannee haras shaakkizita maaqqoday garkk azazoba. <verse eid="1TI 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 6:19"/>Yeyi unttis tiinas mino baaso maaqqeez gishos ye wode unttii tuma de7ay ab aazizako eroda.<verse eid="1TI 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 6:20"/>Ximaatoosa, pettii pettii asay, «Eratithii» giz boozo palamappennee cere odaypp haakkoba; nees inggintteez hadara naagoba. <verse eid="1TI 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 6:21"/>Pettay pettay nuus eratithii yeza yeegttar ammana ashsheeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 6:21">Xooss aadho keehatithay yinttar ubbayir maaqqo.<verse eid="1TI 6:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 6"/>
</usx>
